# Public keys that sign SecureSpeak releases (Ed25519, PEM).
#
# When at least one key is listed here, SecureSpeak only installs an update
# whose SHA256SUMS file carries a valid signature (SHA256SUMS.sig) made with
# the matching private key. The private key is stored only as the GitHub
# secret UPDATE_SIGNING_KEY (and in the maintainer's offline backup).
#
# To rotate keys: add the new public key below, release, and only remove the
# old key once that release has been out for a while.

# jmsuos, added 2026-11-13
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEAPjE7Zxb/3dfdnv78Va10CnvPhpIZmIgcpm4wyHPvF84=
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
